# November 23, 2026: Lawrence, Eudora and Vinland, Douglas County, Kansas. A second pass over Douglas County, which already
# had the trail and territorial sites (data_ks_kwud.py); this one adds what stands in town. Sources: the Kansas Historical
# Society's register summaries for Douglas County (read with page.py), Wikipedia read with wiki_raw.py, and the museums' own
# pages for hours. Coordinates are ArcGIS street-address points checked on the Kansas 2024 aerial. Nothing seen on the ground.
